Description: Tools for the Logitech PRO X 2 mouse (CLI, local panel and GNOME app)
 Command line tool, local web panel and a native GNOME app (myproX2) to read
 the battery and edit the onboard profiles of the Logitech PRO X 2 wireless
 mouse through its Lightspeed receiver.
 .
 Includes a udev rule that gives the logged-in user access to the receiver.
